:"HPpct.webp"},{"name":"HP%","value":"+12%","icon":"HPpct.webp"},{"name":"HP%","value":"+12%","icon":"HPpct.webp"}],"second":"no","why_by_stat":{"Resilience":"Reduces incoming Critical Damage 1%-for-1%, helping Alice survive Critical Hits more easily.","HP%":"Alice requires high HP for bigger heals/barriers."},"story":"\"I'm only showing this to you. If anyone else found out, they'd try to strip me of every last penny of capital and stock-in-trade.\"\n\nAlice inserted her key into a hidden mechanism in the wall and turned it, and the vault door swung open as a cascade of gold ingots and banknotes flooded out from within. Rook stood frozen, dumbstruck with awe by the unimaginable wealth of riches before his eyes, and Alice casually pressed a lump of gold into his hand. But in her gaze, there was no trace of a merchant's calculating shrewdness, but only a quiet warmth as she envisioned beastkin's future."},"used_in":[{"tip":"Adventure (Both)","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENTURE_BOTH.webp"},{"tip":"Tower of Trials","cat":"pve","banner":"TOWER_OF_TRIALS.webp"},{"tip":"Infinite Tower","cat":"pve","banner":"INFINITE_TOWER.webp"},{"tip":"Guild War","cat":"pvp","banner":"GUILDWAR.webp"},{"tip":"Total War","cat":"pvp","banner":"TOTALWAR.webp"},{"tip":"Arena","cat":"pvp","banner":"ARENA.webp"},{"tip":"Real-Time Arena","cat":"pvp","banner":"ARENA_REALTIME.webp"}],"lore":"Alice is a rabbit beastkin who runs a shop that sells goods to the adventurers of Terra Kingdom.\nShe may not show it, but she loves money and has impeccable business acumen.\nShe uses her years of sales experience to make each customer feel like they're having a personalized shopping experience.\nHer shop is always bustling with adventurers because of her reputation of having quality goods and low prices.\nShe's a firm believer in the theory that any kind of problem can be solved by throwing money at it. In spite of this, she lives a rather frugal lifestyle, which has led some people to speculate that she's hiding her wealth for some nefarious purpose.\nIn reality, most of her wealth has been spent on constructing schools and other institutions for cubkin. She often works with Rook and is the main donor backing his anti-discrimination campaign."}